{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50167","headline":"春悲行（伯三七七一下同） · 胡皓","name":"春悲行（伯三七七一下同）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜鹊南飞倦，鸣鸡屡送晨，忽闻芳岁道（到），今日故园春。\n试上亭台望，葐蒀（氛氲）江树新。\n（项云「葐蒀」爲草木茂盛之貌，不烦改。\n）旳旳韶阳蕚，迢迢佳丽人，音容旷不接，景物徒相因。\n别怨如流水，移恩念积薪，垂泪三危露，心斵[一]（「斵」，原卷作「断」。\n）二京尘。\n远役鸿爲伴，荒亭鬼作隣，吾生殊卉木，顦顇此江滨。\n（[一]俞云：「『心斵』疑『心断』。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡皓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}